WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.420
- Well, just when you thought
it couldn't get any dumber

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:04.740
the MyPillow company led by Mike Lindell

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:07.290
has counter-sued Dominion Voting Systems,

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:10.270
seemingly in response to the
Dominion suit against MyPillow

00:00:10.270 --> 00:00:12.150
for billions of dollars
related to defamation.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:14.400
But here, this is especially
crazy because the crux

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.580
of the MyPillow lawsuit is that Dominion,

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:19.949
a private company,
violated somehow MyPillow's

00:00:19.949 --> 00:00:22.280
First Amendment and 14th Amendment rights

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:24.720
and violated Section 1983.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.047
That's not how any of this works.

00:00:26.047 --> 00:00:28.600
Just because a private
company has been contracted

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.180
by a government doesn't mean
that that private company

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:32.920
is the government itself,

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.700
whether they're operating Twitter

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.680
or operating as a company
that helps with voting.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:38.710
That's not how this works.

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:41.020
That's not how any of this works.

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:43.670
So, apparently we'll see them
in court for a very short time

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:45.953
until this lawsuit is easily dismissed.

